          mainPoints: ["Ingress: HTTP/HTTPS routing to services — host and path-based routing.", "Network Policy: pod-to-pod firewall rules — default all traffic is allowed.", "PersistentVolume (PV): cluster storage resource.", "PersistentVolumeClaim (PVC): request for storage from a PV.", "StorageClass: dynamic provisioning of storage volumes."],
